---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const cat = 'Jobs';
---

<BaseLayout title="Remote Administrative Assistant & Executive Assistant Jobs 2026: Complete Guide to Landing a Work-From-Home Admin Career | RemoteWorkHub" description="Complete guide to remote administrative assistant and executive assistant jobs in 2026. Top companies hiring remote admin professionals (GitLab, Automattic, Zapier, HubSpot), salary ranges by specialization from $35K-$130K+, essential skills (calendar management, scheduling, office tools, communication), certifications (CAP, MOS, CVA, PACE), portfolio tips, interview prep, and how to break into remote admin work with or without experience. Includes admin assistant, executive assistant, virtual assistant, office manager, operations coordinator, and chief of staff career paths.">
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-8">
    <header class="mb-8">
      <p class="text-sm text-brand-500 font-medium mb-2">{cat}</p>
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Remote Administrative Assistant & Executive Assistant Jobs 2026: Complete Guide to Landing a Work-From-Home Admin Career | RemoteWorkHub</h1>
      <time class="text-sm text-gray-500">2026</time>
      
      <div class="mt-3 flex gap-2 flex-wrap">
        <span class="text-xs bg-gray-700 text-gray-300 px-2 py-1 rounded">jobs</span>
        <span class="text-xs bg-gray-700 text-gray-300 px-2 py-1 rounded">admin</span>
        <span class="text-xs bg-gray-700 text-gray-300 px-2 py-1 rounded">executive-assistant</span>
        <span class="text-xs bg-gray-700 text-gray-300 px-2 py-1 rounded">virtual-assistant</span>
        <span class="text-xs bg-gray-700 text-gray-300 px-2 py-1 rounded">career</span>
        <span class="text-xs bg-gray-700 text-gray-300 px-2 py-1 rounded">entry-level</span>
        <span class="text-xs bg-gray-700 text-gray-300 px-2 py-1 rounded">operations</span>
      </div>
    </header>
    <div class="prose prose-invert prose-gray max-w-none">
      <p>Complete guide to remote administrative assistant and executive assistant jobs in 2026. Top companies hiring remote admin professionals (GitLab, Automattic, Zapier, HubSpot), salary ranges by specialization from $35K-$130K+, essential skills (calendar management, scheduling, office tools, communication), certifications (CAP, MOS, CVA, PACE), portfolio tips, interview prep, and how to break into remote admin work with or without experience. Includes admin assistant, executive assistant, virtual assistant, office manager, operations coordinator, and chief of staff career paths.</p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
